tagLighting
  golden hour
  dramatic rim light
  volumetric god rays
  neon glow
  soft moonlight
  warm candlelight
  studio softbox
  backlit silhouette
  harsh midday sun
  bioluminescent glow
  overcast daylight
  torchlight

tagCamera
  close-up portrait
  wide establishing shot
  dutch angle
  cinematic composition
  bird's-eye view
  low-angle hero shot
  macro detail
  aerial drone view
  over-the-shoulder shot
  telephoto compression

tagMood
  epic and triumphant
  mysterious and eerie
  tranquil and serene
  whimsical and playful
  melancholic
  ominous and foreboding
  dreamy and ethereal
  cozy and warm
  dramatic and intense
  hopeful and radiant

tagQuality
  masterpiece
  highly detailed
  intricate details
  sharp focus
  ultra-detailed textures
  trending on artstation
  professional digital art
  award-winning illustration
  breathtaking composition

// ============================================================================
//  CHANNELS (curated bundles)
//  Each channel limits the style dropdown to its `styleKeys` (omit = all
//  styles) and provides channel-specific `subjects`/`scenes` chips.
